	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c14_swrival_06"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『なんだ
おおらかというか　むせきにんというか▼
なんか　きせいを　そがれたけど
あいては　プラズマだんだ！▽
きを　ひきしめて　いくぜ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-18T05:09:27" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-13T07:36:56" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『なんだ
おおらかというか　無責任というか▼
なんか　気勢を　削がれたけど
相手は　プラズマ団だ！▽
気を　ひきしめて　行くぜ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-18T05:09:14" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-13T07:36:56" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・表示後、w21方面へ移動
・画面外に消えると操作可能
・1＝ライバル名</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-17T05:12:31" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWRIVAL
ライバル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-13T07:36:52" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
